# interfacectl Development

This repo (`/Users/mike/Cursor/interfacectl/`) is the canonical location for interfacectl development. Do not edit the submodule copy at `surfaces-monorepo/tools/interfacectl/` for source changes—edit here, then update the submodule reference after merging.

## Dogfooding

When testing against surfaces-monorepo: build here, then run the CLI with `--workspace-root /Users/mike/Cursor/surfaces-monorepo`. Do not copy dist into the submodule.

## Order of operations (release)

1. Edit here → build → dogfood (run CLI with `--workspace-root` surfaces-monorepo)
2. Commit and push interfacectl; merge PR
3. In surfaces-monorepo: update submodule to new commit, commit, push
